@startuml
title UC-002 — Suite 평가와 baseline 회귀 판정
note as N
Product 명세 UC-002
end note
actor "workflow 유지 관리자/사용자" as Maintainer
actor harness as Harness
actor "평가자/검토자" as Evaluator
rectangle "행동 평가 suite" {
  usecase "케이스 suite와 baseline 선택" as Choose
  usecase "각 케이스를 독립적으로 실행" as Run
  usecase "통과율, 품질, inconclusive health,\n효율 집계" as Aggregate
  usecase "baseline과 비교하고\nsuite 임계값 적용" as Decide
  usecase "suite 통과 또는 실패 판정" as Result
}
Maintainer --> Choose
Choose --> Run
Harness --> Run
Run --> Aggregate
Harness --> Aggregate
Aggregate --> Decide
Evaluator --> Decide
Decide --> Result
note right of Decide
hard_gate_failures, 핵심 통과율, 품질,
inconclusive health, token·latency 회귀를 포함한다.
end note
@enduml
